<view class="welcome-page">
  <view
    class="welcome-header"
    style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px; min-height: {{navigationHeight}}px; padding-right: {{menuInset}}px;"
  >
    <view class="brand-rule" aria-hidden="true"></view>
    <view class="brand-copy">
      <text class="brand-name">恋爱笔记</text>
      <text class="brand-note">两个人的生活记录</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="welcome-main">
    <view class="welcome-intro">
      <text class="welcome-kicker">欢迎来到恋爱笔记</text>
      <view class="welcome-title">
        <text>普通的日子，</text>
        <text>也值得认真留下。</text>
      </view>
      <text class="welcome-note">照片、视频和随手写下的话，会按原来的样子留在这里。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="welcome-questions" aria-label="登录前说明">
      <view class="welcome-question">
        <view class="question-copy">
          <text class="question-title">另一半会自动看到吗？</text>
          <text class="question-answer">不会。每条记录都由你决定是否共享，旧内容不会因为配对自动公开。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="welcome-question">
        <view class="question-copy">
          <text class="question-title">为什么需要微信登录？</text>
          <text class="question-answer">登录用来确认你的身份，并在你主动分享时识别双方权限。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="welcome-actions">
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="status-banner status-banner--error" role="alert">
      <text class="status-banner__copy">{{error}}</text>
      <button hover-class="is-pressed" hover-stay-time="120" bindtap="login">重试</button>
    </view>

    <view class="agreement press" hover-class="is-pressed" hover-stay-time="120" role="checkbox" aria-checked="{{agreed}}" aria-label="同意用户协议和隐私保护指引" tabindex="0" bindtap="toggleAgree">
      <view class="checkbox {{agreed ? 'checked' : ''}}" aria-hidden="true">{{agreed ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
      <view class="agreement-copy">
        <text>我已阅读并同意</text>
        <text class="agreement-link" role="link" catchtap="openUserAgreement">《用户协议》</text>
        <text>和</text>
        <text class="agreement-link" role="link" catchtap="openPrivacy">《隐私保护指引》</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button
      class="primary-button press"
      loading="{{loading}}"
      disabled="{{loading}}"
      hover-class="is-pressed"
      hover-stay-time="120"
      aria-label="{{loading ? '正在登录' : agreed ? '微信登录，开始记录' : '微信登录；继续前需先同意用户协议和隐私保护指引'}}"
      bindtap="login"
    >
      {{loading ? '正在登录' : '微信登录，开始记录'}}
    </button>

    <text class="welcome-privacy">默认私密。只有你主动设为共同可见的内容，TA 才能查看。</text>
  </view>
</view>
